  unitName: Dean
  unitId: 20162
  unitNumber: 242
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. Originally a high-ranking priest who specialized in ice magic, his
    refusal to bow down to authority resulted in his superiors exiling him into the
    wilderness. Plunged into despair by the gods\u2019 attack on Palmyna and with
    nowhere to turn, he was relieved one day to receive a visit from a female knight
    and an old man, who invited him on a journey to defeat the rampaging gods."
  summonDesc: "You\u2019re the one who summoned me, eh?<br>There\u2019s no need to
    look quite so smug about it.<br>I can still decide to leave, you know."
  fusionDesc: "Borrowing power from the likes of you...<br>My, how the mighty have
    fallen.<br>Still, can\u2019t complain, I guess."
